3,9.77,9.49,9.61,445200],[9.59,9.62,9.2,9.57,686900],[9.52,9.52,9.15,9.41,992700]],"about":{"what":"DocGo Inc. (DCGO). This chart runs from May 17, 2022 to Sep 23, 2022.","setup":"The stock rose about 73% in the three months before the base. It then formed a base for about 8 weeks, peaking at $8.57 and pulling back 25% at its deepest. Daily price ranges tightened on the right side of the base.","outcome":"On Aug 5, 2022 it closed at $8.71, its first close above the base high of $8.57. Volume that day was 778K shares, 2.06x the prior 10-day average of 377K. It held, never closing below the level three days running, reached a best close of $10.49, and the chart ends at $9.41.","lesson":"This is an example of a textbook breakout: a base, then a close above it on heavy volume, and it held. This is the pattern the rules are built around."}}